      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SILENT REVERIE (2) turned in a good effort last start when runner-up at this venue, beaten a nose after leading from wider. That was her third placing from her last four starts so her hoof is on the till and she has the speed to be prominent from the low draw. Primary contender. SKYVALLEY BOY (8) has not raced for ten weeks but has won when fresh before and looks forward enough for the return after three trials, placing in the last two. Drawn to enjoy an economical run and the sprint lane is in play. JESSICAS STORY (4) didn't do a bad job when fifth from the back row at Shepparton last time out after placing from this barrier here prior. AT THE DISTANCE (5) is back from a let-up but came from this barrier to win four back at Melton.",
